micro-devices ticker AMD is today's simulated weekly hold on the NASDAQ. A

00:03:28.058 --> 00:03:32.538
$1,000 share position entered at the next session's open and scored against

00:03:32.538 --> 00:03:37.938
the NASDAQ over five sessions. This is a simulated trade for learning purposes. The

