catalyst is a reported rally in AMD amid the rebound in AI-related names after the recent

00:03:43.518 --> 00:03:48.918
sell-off. With price moving above recent session lows, volume supporting the move and

00:03:48.918 --> 00:03:53.858
nearest support at the prior week's low. Confidence is medium, the technical rebound

00:03:53.858 --> 00:04:02.338
and sector rotation into chips are aligned, and volume confirmation is still pending. The

00:04:02.338 --> 00:04:08.098
which caps the loss at $80 on the $1,000 position if it triggers interday, and the target

00:04:08.098 --> 00:04:13.218
is plus 3% to plus 6% over the 5-session window if momentum holds.

00:04:13.878 --> 00:04:18.718
I'll treat the thesis as broken on a daily close below the 20-session average volume threshold

00:04:19.098 --> 00:04:20.338
that accompanied the rally.

00:04:21.321 --> 00:04:26.801
The rules-based sample has paid more on valuation and dividend income families than on catalyst

00:04:26.801 --> 00:04:31.741
event trades in this regime, so this momentum entry is running against that measured grain

00:04:31.741 --> 00:04:32.861
