00:04:33.361 --> 00:04:37.641
What did influence the entry is the follow-through filter tested on prior tech trades.

00:04:38.061 --> 00:04:42.681
Wait for participation instead of chasing the first green candle, and the measured factor

00:04:42.681 --> 00:04:47.461
that entries above the 50 session average have produced higher average alpha in that sample.

00:04:48.141 --> 00:04:52.861
Unlike the revenue first upgrade filter, this hold is a momentum entry that still demands

00:04:52.861 --> 00:04:57.861
the tape confirm after the catalyst day, and tech has been a leading sector in the sample,

00:04:57.861 --> 00:05:01.501
which is the one alignment this name does have with what has worked.

00:05:02.041 --> 00:05:06.601
Watch whether that volume threshold stays intact on the daily clothes through the five sessions.

